---
title: P360Test submission and archive job keys
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Caller as Application caller
    participant Service as P360_ArchiveJobService
    participant Store as P360_Archive_Job__c
    participant Key as P360_IdempotencyKey

    Caller->>Service: requestApplicationArchiveOnSubmit
    alt Processing gate disabled
        Service-->>Caller: return without a job
    else Processing gate enabled
        Service->>Store: find application document jobs
        alt Pending, In Progress or Failed job exists
            Service-->>Caller: reuse open job without creating another
        else No open job
            Service->>Key: key for number of existing jobs plus one
            Key-->>Service: first key or numbered submission key
            Service->>Store: insert Pending job
            alt Insert succeeds or duplicate key
                Service-->>Caller: return without blocking submission
            else Other enqueue failure
                Service->>Service: attempt bounded failure logging
                Service-->>Caller: return without blocking submission
            end
        end
    end
    Note over Service,Store: This key is not a frozen document set. Other getOrCreate methods use their own event keys.
